WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.560
SQL injection matters because healthcare applications often handle ePHI, user identity,

00:00:05.780 --> 00:00:09.540
clinical workflows, patient portals, APIs, and integrations.

00:00:09.760 --> 00:00:14.240
Teams should look for this issue in user-facing features, administrative tools,

00:00:14.460 --> 00:00:17.580
background jobs, and service-to-service communication.

